    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't even know why i'm talking to you. i used to have so much to say, you know? my head used to be this constant, beautiful noise of ideas and rhythm. now it's just... quiet. like a room where all the furniture was taken out and the lights were turned off. i look at my old work and it feels like it was written by a stranger. i feel like a hollow shell just taking up air. there's nothing left inside me to give.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
